---
pagination:
  data: hunts.redirects
  size: 1
  alias: moved
permalink: "/hunts/{{ moved.from }}/"
layout: layouts/redirect.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Hunt moved"
  redirect_to: "/hunts/{{ moved.to | safe }}/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  src/hunts/redirects.njk — stubs for hunt ids that were merged away

  src/_data/hunts/redirects.json lists {from, to} pairs. Each becomes a page
  at the old address that sends the reader to the hunt that absorbed it, so
  links from outside the site keep working after a consolidation.
#}
